GET {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pan-aadhaar-link/verify/a957d82c-987c-4fa9-b69f-6765dc3c1035

### Aadhaar masking (sync) - masks the Aadhaar number in the image, returns URLs
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/aadhaar/mask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/aadhaar.jpg",
  "consent": true
}

### Face compare (sync) - two images, returns match result
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/face/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/face1.jpg",
  "document2": "https://example.com/face2.jpg"
}

